    "image_path": "images/slide_24.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "毛毛虫美育馆\n《彩蛋》延伸美术活动\n串彩蛋\n红蛋、黄蛋、蓝蛋，串成彩蛋一串串。\n材料准备：\n红、黄、蓝三色橡皮泥，竹签（或筷子）。\n1. 取适量三原色橡皮泥，搓成红、黄、蓝三种颜色的蛋。（图1）\n（小贴士：蛋的大小可随意搓；可以把三原色橡皮泥两两混合搓成橙、紫、绿色的蛋；还可以把三原色混合揉搓成褐色蛋。）",
    "page_text_en": "Mao Mao Chong Art Gallery\nExtended Art Activity for 'Colorful Eggs'\nStringing Colorful Eggs\nRed eggs, yellow eggs, blue eggs, strung together into colorful egg strings.\nMaterials needed:\nRed, yellow, and blue modeling clay, bamboo skewers (or chopsticks).\n1. Take an appropriate amount of primary-colored modeling clay and roll it into red, yellow, and blue eggs. (Figure 1)\n(Tip: The size of the eggs can be rolled freely; you can mix two primary colors to roll orange, purple, and green eggs; you can also mix all three primary colors to roll brown eggs.)",
    "summary_zh": "本页介绍了一个名为“串彩蛋”的美术手工活动，展示了所需材料和第一步操作：用红、黄、蓝三色橡皮泥搓成彩蛋，并配有小女孩完成作品后开心鼓掌的照片。"
  },
